{"seq":2,"slug":"cascade-routing","title":"级联路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-cost-latency-optimization/model-routing/cascade-routing","wordCount":2480,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"级联路由\">级联路由</h1><p>模型分级回答了「哪类任务用哪档模型」，级联路由（cascade routing）回答的是工程问题：在请求到来的那一刻，由谁、根据什么信号、以多大代价做出这个选择。路由器是分级策略的执行机构，它的设计质量直接决定分级能省下多少钱、又会引入多少新的错误面。业界实践反复验证：一个设计良好的级联路由系统相比「一律用旗舰模型」通常能节省 50–70% 的推理成本，而质量损失可以控制在评测指标的几个百分点以内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>级联路由的核心是四个概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>路由器（router）</strong>：分级策略的执行机构，回答「由谁、根据什么信号、以多大代价做出选档决策」。</li>\n<li><strong>三种形态</strong>：规则路由（静态特征）、分类器路由（前置预判难度）、置信度级联（先答再评、低置信升级），复杂度与能力逐级递增且不互斥。</li>\n<li><strong>升级率（p）</strong>：小模型答案被判定不合格、需要大模型重做的比例，是级联成本数学中唯一的变量。</li>\n<li><strong>可审计性</strong>：路由决策必须作为 trace 中的显式 span 记录，否则无法排障、聚合分析与合规证明。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三种形态在一条请求上的分工如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[请求进入] --&gt; B[规则路由]&#10;    B --&gt;|命中确定性规则| C[直接选定档位]&#10;    B --&gt;|未命中| D[分类器路由: 预判难度]&#10;    D --&gt; E[小模型作答]&#10;    E --&gt; F{置信度达标?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[返回小模型答案]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[升级到大模型重做]&#10;    C --&gt; I[记录路由 trace span]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[请求进入] --&gt; B[规则路由]\n    B --&gt;|命中确定性规则| C[直接选定档位]\n    B --&gt;|未命中| D[分类器路由: 预判难度]\n    D --&gt; E[小模型作答]\n    E --&gt; F{置信度达标?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[返回小模型答案]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[升级到大模型重做]\n    C --&gt; I[记录路由 trace span]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><p>成熟系统通常是三者的混合体：规则层处理确定性场景并兼作路由 hotfix，剩余流量走分类器或级联。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路由器的三种实现形态\">路由器的三种实现形态</h2><p>按决策信号的来源和成本，路由器可以分为三种形态，复杂度和能力逐级递增：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>决策依据</th>\n<th>额外延迟</th>\n<th>额外成本</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规则路由</td>\n<td>请求的静态特征</td>\n<td>接近零</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>任务类型与端点强绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分类器路由</td>\n<td>小模型或轻量分类器预判难度</td>\n<td>一次小模型调用</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>同一入口混合多种难度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>置信度级联</td>\n<td>先答再评，低置信升级</td>\n<td>升级时翻倍</td>\n<td>与升级率挂钩</td>\n<td>难度无法事前判断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>规则路由</strong>根据可以直接观察的特征做确定性分发：按功能入口（自动补全走小模型、深度分析走旗舰）、按输入长度（超长上下文的综合任务升档）、按语言（小模型在低资源语言上质量下降明显时升档）、按用户层级（付费用户路由到更强的模型）。它零成本、零延迟、完全可预测，应该是任何路由系统的第一层——能用规则解决的就不要动用模型。</p>\n<p><strong>分类器路由</strong>在规则无法区分难度时引入一个前置判断步骤：用一个小模型（或微调过的轻量分类器、甚至 embedding 相似度匹配）给请求打难度标签，再据此分发。它的优点是单次决策、延迟可控；缺点是分类器本身会错，而且「判断一个问题有多难」有时几乎和「解决这个问题」一样难——对于表面简单实则有陷阱的请求，分类器倾向于低估难度。</p>\n<p><strong>置信度级联</strong>则把判断推迟到事后：先让小模型直接作答，再评估答案的置信度，低于阈值时丢弃并升级到更强的模型重做。置信度信号可以来自模型的 logprobs、自我评估（让模型给自己的答案打分）、独立的验证器（如 JSON schema 校验、单元测试、LLM-as-judge），或多次采样的一致性。级联的好处是利用了「做了才知道难不难」的信息；代价是升级路径上延迟翻倍，且自我评估类信号普遍存在过度自信的偏差，需要用真实数据校准阈值。</p>\n<p>三种形态并不互斥，成熟系统通常是混合体：规则路由先处理确定性场景，剩余流量走分类器或级联。</p>\n<h2 id=\"级联的成本数学\">级联的成本数学</h2><p>级联是否划算可以用一个简单模型算清楚。设小模型单位成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、大模型为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、升级率（小模型答案被判定不合格、需要大模型重做的比例）为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，则级联的期望成本为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = c_s + p \\cdot c_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>与全部直接用大模型相比，节省比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - (c_s/c_l + p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。代入典型价格比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_s/c_l \\approx 1/15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/15</span></span></span></span></span>，不同升级率下的节省如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>升级率 p</th>\n<th>期望成本（相对全用大模型）</th>\n<th>节省比例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>约 0.17</td>\n<td>约 83%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30%</td>\n<td>约 0.37</td>\n<td>约 63%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>约 0.57</td>\n<td>约 43%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>70%</td>\n<td>约 0.77</td>\n<td>约 23%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>93%+</td>\n<td>≥1.0</td>\n<td>开始倒贴</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表给出两个直观结论。第一，级联的盈亏平衡点很宽松：只要升级率低于约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>93</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - c_s/c_l \\approx 93\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">93%</span></span></span></span></span>，级联在成本上就不亏，所以即使小模型只能独立解决一半的请求，级联依然能省四成以上。第二，真正的约束往往不是成本而是延迟：升级路径上用户要等两次推理，如果 30% 的请求延迟翻倍是产品不可接受的，升级率就必须压得比成本盈亏点低得多。此外这个模型还隐藏了一项成本——置信度评估本身（验证器调用、judge 调用）也要计入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，评估开销过大的级联会迅速失去优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路由错误的检测与校正回路\">路由错误的检测与校正回路</h2><p>路由器是会出错的组件，必须为它建立独立的质量回路，而不是部署后放任不管：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>影子评测（shadow evaluation）</strong>：抽样一部分被路由到小模型的请求，同时用大模型跑一遍，离线比较两边答案。两者的分歧率是「降档质量损失」最直接的度量，也是发现分类器系统性盲区（某类请求总被误判为简单）的主要手段。</li>\n<li><strong>下游信号回流</strong>：用户的重试、改写提问、点踩、人工客服升级，都是路由可能错了的弱信号。把这些信号按路由决策聚合，能定位「哪类请求在小模型上体验崩了」。</li>\n<li><strong>阈值定期重校准</strong>：置信度阈值是在某个时点的数据上调出来的；流量分布漂移、模型版本升级都会让旧阈值失效。应当把阈值校准做成例行任务，而不是一次性工程。</li>\n<li><strong>校正快路径</strong>：发现某类请求被系统性误路由时，最快的修复是加一条规则把它强制升档（规则层优先级高于分类器），再从容地重训分类器或调阈值。规则层因此也承担着「路由 hotfix」的角色。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个值得警惕的失败模式是「沉默的质量滑坡」：级联在成本仪表盘上表现完美，升级率稳定走低，但那是因为置信度评估器变得过度自信，大量不合格答案没有被升级。这正是影子评测不可省略的原因——成本指标自己不会报告质量问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路由决策进-trace-可审计性\">路由决策进 trace：可审计性</h2><p>路由决策本身是系统行为的一部分，必须和模型调用一起进入可观测体系。每条请求的 trace 至少应记录：命中的路由层（规则/分类器/级联）、决策依据（命中的规则名、分类器打分、置信度数值与阈值）、最终使用的模型与 effort 档位、是否发生升级以及升级原因。</p>\n<p>这些字段支撑三类关键场景。其一是<strong>单请求排障</strong>：用户投诉某次回答质量差时，第一个要回答的问题是「这条请求被路由到了哪个模型、为什么」——没有 trace 就只能猜。其二是<strong>聚合分析</strong>：按路由路径切分质量与成本指标，才能回答「分类器路由的那部分流量升级率是多少」「上周的成本上涨是流量变难了还是阈值漂了」这类问题。其三是<strong>合规与审计</strong>：当某些请求类别被强制要求使用特定模型（如数据驻留、安全等级要求）时，trace 是证明路由策略被正确执行的唯一证据。</p>\n<p>实践建议是把路由决策建模为 trace 中一个显式的 span，而不是散落在日志里的几行文本；并给路由配置加上版本号，记录在每条 trace 中——这样回溯历史问题时能准确还原「当时生效的是哪一版路由策略」，而不是用今天的配置去解释上个月的行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>路由器是分级策略的执行机构，其设计质量直接决定省多少钱、又引入多少新错误面。</li>\n<li>三种形态逐级递增且可混合：规则路由零成本零延迟，分类器路由单次决策但会错，置信度级联利用「做了才知道难不难」但升级时延迟翻倍。</li>\n<li>级联成本数学很简单：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = c_s + p \\cdot c_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，盈亏平衡点宽松（升级率低于约 93% 就不亏），真正的约束往往是延迟。</li>\n<li>路由器必须建立独立质量回路：影子评测、下游信号回流、阈值定期重校准、校正快路径。</li>\n<li>最危险的失败模式是「沉默的质量滑坡」——成本指标完美，但置信度评估器变过度自信导致不合格答案未被升级。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 的 <a href=\"model-tiering\">模型分级</a>：路由器所执行的三档画像、难度分配框架与错误代价分析。</li>\n<li>本 hub 的 <a href=\"../cost-latency-model/measuring-and-budgeting\">度量与预算</a>：trace 字段与影子评测所依托的度量底座。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"级联路由","id":"级联路由"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"路由器的三种实现形态","id":"路由器的三种实现形态"},{"level":2,"text":"级联的成本数学","id":"级联的成本数学"},{"level":2,"text":"路由错误的检测与校正回路","id":"路由错误的检测与校正回路"},{"level":2,"text":"路由决策进 trace：可审计性","id":"路由决策进-trace-可审计性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"模型分级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-cost-latency-optimization/model-routing/model-tiering"},"next":{"title":"降级与容灾","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-cost-latency-optimization/model-routing/fallback-degradation"}}